Two overlapping windows, then resize to a tiny screen. Each window's rescaled
rectangle falls below the minimum width (100) and height (2*margin+fontheight),
so flresize snaps its edges back to the screen rectangle -- the small-rect clamp
branches a moderate resize never reaches.

-- input --
move 300 8
button 4
move 300 116
button 0
move 150 100
button 4
move 450 250
button 0
move 300 8
button 4
move 300 29
button 0
move 350 200
button 4
button 0
move 280 180
button 4
move 560 340
button 0
resize 96 96
move 100 10
button 1
button 0
